---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import PoolStatus from "../components/PoolStatus.astro";
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Animica Mining Pool"
  description="Connect to the Animica mining pool. PoW + AICF compute, one machine, two earnings streams. Hardware-aware tier selection."
>
  <section class="bg-gradient-to-b from-ink-900 to-ink-950 border-b border-white/5">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 py-16 md:py-24">
      <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-[1.2fr_1fr] gap-12 items-center">
        <div>
          <span class="inline-block text-amber-400 text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] font-semibold mb-4">
            pool.animica.org
          </span>
          <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-semibold tracking-tight leading-tight">
            One miner.<br/>
            <span class="text-amber-400">Two earnings streams.</span>
          </h1>
          <p class="mt-6 text-lg text-ink-200 max-w-xl">
            Connect your hardware to the Animica pool. Earn block rewards via PoW
            and AICF credits by serving inference jobs for <code class="font-mono text-amber-400">animica chat</code> users — on the same machine.
          </p>
          <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
            <a href="#connect"
              class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl bg-amber-500 hover:bg-amber-400 text-ink-950 font-semibold px-5 py-3 transition">
              Connect now →
            </a>
            <a href="/aicf"
              class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl border border-white/15 hover:border-amber-400/50 text-ink-50 px-5 py-3 transition">
              AICF compute
            </a>
            <a href="/tiers"
              class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl border border-white/15 hover:border-amber-400/50 text-ink-50 px-5 py-3 transition">
              Pick your tier
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <PoolStatus />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="connect" class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 py-16">
    <h2 class="text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight mb-2">Connect in three commands</h2>
    <p class="text-ink-300 mb-8 max-w-2xl">
      One command (<code class="font-mono text-amber-400">animica miner mine-blocks</code>)
      runs both PoW and the AICF inference worker side-by-side. No local full
      node required &mdash; point AICF at any reachable endpoint with
      <code class="font-mono">--aicf-endpoint</code>.
    </p>
    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.03] p-5">
        <div class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wide text-amber-400 font-semibold mb-3">Step 1 — install</div>
        <pre class="bg-ink-950/80 rounded-lg p-4 text-sm font-mono overflow-x-auto"><code>pip install animica</code></pre>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-ink-300">
          Bundles the chain CLI, the AI compute worker, and the hardware
          detector. Nothing else to install.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.03] p-5">
        <div class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wide text-amber-400 font-semibold mb-3">Step 2 — install AI model</div>
        <pre class="bg-ink-950/80 rounded-lg p-4 text-sm font-mono overflow-x-auto"><code>animica miner setup</code></pre>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-ink-300">
          Detects CPU/RAM/GPU, picks the tier(s) your machine can serve, and
          downloads the matching model bundles into
          <code class="font-mono">~/.animica/models/</code>. Re-run any time
          you change hardware.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.03] p-5">
        <div class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wide text-amber-400 font-semibold mb-3">Step 3 — start mining</div>
        <pre class="bg-ink-950/80 rounded-lg p-4 text-sm font-mono overflow-x-auto"><code>animica miner mine-blocks \
  --address anim1... \
  --pool-stratum stratum+tcp://pool.animica.org:5333 \
  --aicf-endpoint https://rpc.pool.animica.org/aicf \
  --count 0</code></pre>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-ink-300">
          PoW + AICF both run from this one command. AICF is on by default;
          opt out with <code class="font-mono">--no-aicf</code>.
          <code class="font-mono">--aicf-endpoint</code> removes the need for a
          local Animica node.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 py-16 border-t border-white/5">
    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12">
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight mb-3">Hardware-aware tier selection</h2>
        <p class="text-ink-300 mb-4">
          Run <code class="font-mono bg-ink-900 px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-amber-400">animica miner setup</code>
          to detect your hardware and pre-install the model tier(s) you're
          eligible to serve. The pool routes AICF jobs to the smallest tier
          that satisfies the request — your machine earns from whatever it
          can serve.
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-ink-200">
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-amber-400">●</span> Auto-detects CPU, RAM, GPU VRAM</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-amber-400">●</span> Advertises capabilities to AICF on registration</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-amber-400">●</span> Falls back to a smaller tier on detection failure</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-ink-950 p-6">
        <pre class="text-sm font-mono text-ink-100 overflow-x-auto"><code><span class="text-amber-400">$</span> animica miner setup
<span class="text-ink-300">{
  "os": "Linux",
  "arch": "x86_64",
  "cpu_cores_logical": 16,
  "ram_gb": 64.0,
  "gpus": [
    {`{`}
      "name": "NVIDIA RTX 4090",
      "vram_gb": 24.0,
      "backend": "cuda"
    {`}`}
  ],
  "accelerator_preferred": "cuda",
  "eligible_tiers": ["tiny", "small", "flagship"]
}</span></code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 py-16 border-t border-white/5">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight mb-3">Two earnings streams</h2>
    <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-6 mt-8">
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.03] p-6">
        <div class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wide text-amber-400 font-semibold mb-2">PoW</div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold">Block rewards</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-ink-300">
          Hashing for the Animica chain. Pays out per share via the existing
          stratum protocol. The chain consensus is unchanged — same coinbase,
          same difficulty, same payout model.
        </p>
        <a href="/stats" class="mt-4 inline-block text-amber-400 hover:underline text-sm">View pool stats →</a>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.03] p-6">
        <div class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wide text-amber-400 font-semibold mb-2">AICF</div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold">Compute credits</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-ink-300">
          Serve inference jobs for <code class="font-mono text-amber-400">animica chat</code> users.
          Earn ANIMICA per completed job. Spare cycles count — the AICF worker
          schedules around your PoW load.
        </p>
        <a href="/aicf" class="mt-4 inline-block text-amber-400 hover:underline text-sm">Learn about AICF →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
